ENDPOINTS (backend, http://localhost:8000 — interactive docs at /docs)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Auth (there is no /auth/register: it returns 404)
    POST /auth/login      { email, password } -> access_token, refresh_token, user
    POST /auth/refresh    { refresh_token } -> new access_token
    POST /auth/logout     { refresh_token } -> 204, the token is revoked
    GET  /auth/me         current user (needs "Authorization: Bearer <access_token>")
    GET  /auth/sektoret   public list of sectors (top-level kategorite) for the user form

Role-protected examples (one per role; other roles get 403)
    GET /inspektor/paneli    inspektor only
    GET /drejtor/paneli      drejtor only
    GET /admin/paneli        admin only

Admin user management (admin only)
    GET   /admin/users                   list all staff users
    POST  /admin/users                   create a user (any role) — the only way to add staff
    PATCH /admin/users/{id}              edit name, email, role, sector, phone, aktiv
    POST  /admin/users/{id}/deactivate   aktiv = false + revoke all their sessions

Error messages are in Albanian, e.g. "Email ose fjalëkalim i pasaktë",
"Nuk keni leje për këtë veprim".

