HOW TO TEST   (full testing guide, incl. unit and Selenium tests: docs/12)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Backend API tests (43 integration tests, from the project root):
       backend\venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest test\integration -v
   They use a SEPARATE database, `inspektorati_test`, which is dropped,
